(Bug #80, every spelling of the possessive that the order dependence
 reached: the bare read, the article, the write target, the format hole,
 and a chain through a nested thing. All five name globals declared below
 the functions that read them.)

A thing called leg has
  a number called start is 3.

A thing called route has
  a number called length is 12,
  a leg called outbound.

To 'read it'.
  Print trip's length.
  Print the trip's length.
  Print "length is {trip's length}".
  Print trip's outbound's start.

To 'write it'.
  Set trip's length to 20.
  Set trip's outbound's start to 5.

a route called trip.

'read it'.
'write it'.
Print trip's length.
Print trip's outbound's start.
Exit 0.
